  I think the problem you and I are having is the meaning of the word
"specific".  We are not talking here of "steci", but more like the
following definitions of specific from m-w.com:
1a : constituting or falling into a specifiable category
b : sharing or being those properties of something that allow it to be
referred to a particular category
4 of, relating to, or constituting a species and especially a biological
species

 i.e. klesi or jutsi

  When I say "mi me la'oi turniansky"  It means "I am of the
category/species Turniansky"  If I say "mi me lao'i Turniansky lo ka jbena"
it means "I am Turnainsky by birth"

       --gejyspa



